<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vaultique | FAQ</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
   
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/nav-bar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/footer.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/Assets/Images/LogoV.jpg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/Loading Screen.css">
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/FAQ.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
   
    <script src="/Javascript/nav-bar.js"></script>
    <script src="/Javascript/Loading Screen.js"></script>
    <script src="/Javascript/Light-Mode.js"></script>
    <script src="/Javascript/FAQ.js"></script>
   
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/loading-screen') %>
    <%- include('partials/navigation') %>
    <!-- Theme Toggle Button -->
   

    <main class="faq-container">
        <br>
        <br>
        <br>
        <br>
        <br>
        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        
       

        <div class="faq-list">
            <!-- Ordering Questions -->
            <div class="faq-item" data-category="ordering">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>How do I place an order?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>To place an order, simply browse our collection, select your desired watch, customize it if desired, and click "Add to Cart". Follow the checkout process to complete your purchase.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="ordering">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>What payment methods do you accept?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We accept all major credit cards (Visa, MasterCard, American Express), PayPal, and bank transfers. All payments are processed securely through our encrypted payment system.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="ordering">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>Is my payment information secure?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Absolutely. We use industry-standard SSL encryption to protect your payment information. We never store your full credit card details on our servers.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="ordering">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>Do you offer installment plans?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, we offer flexible installment plans through our financing partners. At checkout, you can select the installment option and choose a payment plan that suits your budget.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Shipping Questions -->
            <div class="faq-item" data-category="shipping">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>How long does shipping take?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Standard shipping typically takes 3-5 business days within the continental US. International shipping may take 7-14 business days depending on the destination.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="shipping">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>Do you ship internationally?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, we ship to most countries worldwide. International shipping rates and delivery times vary by location. You can view shipping options during checkout.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="shipping">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>Is shipping insured?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>All shipments are fully insured against loss or damage during transit. You can shop with confidence knowing your purchase is protected from our facility to your doorstep.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="shipping">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>Can I track my order?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, once your order ships, you'll receive a tracking number via email. You can use this number on our website or the carrier's website to monitor your package's journey.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Warranty Questions -->
            <div class="faq-item" data-category="warranty">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>What is your warranty policy?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>All our watches come with a 5-year international warranty covering manufacturing defects. The warranty does not cover damage from accidents, misuse, or normal wear and tear.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="warranty">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>Do your watches come with a warranty?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, every Vaultique watch comes with our comprehensive 5-year warranty. We also offer extended warranty options for collectors and enthusiasts.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="warranty">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>How do I service my watch?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We recommend professional servicing every 3-5 years. You can schedule service through our website, or visit one of our authorized service centers worldwide.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="warranty">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>What if my watch needs repair?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Contact our customer service team to initiate a repair request. Most repairs are completed within 2-4 weeks and covered under warranty if applicable.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Returns Questions -->
            <div class="faq-item" data-category="returns">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>What is your return policy?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We offer a 30-day return policy for all unworn watches in their original condition. Customized watches are not eligible for returns unless they arrive damaged or defective.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="returns">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>How do I initiate a return?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>To initiate a return, contact our customer service team within 30 days of delivery. Include your order number and reason for return. We'll provide you with return shipping instructions.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="returns">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>How long do refunds take to process?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Once we receive your return, refunds are processed within 3-5 business days. It may take an additional 5-10 business days for the refund to appear on your original payment method.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-item" data-category="returns">
                <div class="faq-question">
                    <h3>Do I have to pay return shipping?</h3>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>For returns due to our error or defective products, we cover return shipping. For other returns, customers are responsible for return shipping costs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    
        <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>